        "comment": "Forecast Snow Stability: New windslab will develop on West to North aspects mainly above 1000 metres.  Although poorly bonded these accumulations are expected to be isolated, sometimes localised and mostly affect coire rims and the tops of gullies. On these aspects fragile cornices will develop.  Wind exposed areas will become scoured. The avalanche hazard will be Low.",
